# Shared Contracts (`@workflow/shared`)

- Single source of truth for DTOs, Zod schemas, catalog ids, and constants used by more than one app.
- Export schema + inferred type together: `export const ZapSchema = z.object(...); export type Zap = z.infer<typeof ZapSchema>;`
- No runtime dependencies besides `zod`. No Node-only or Angular-only APIs (must run in both).
- No business logic or I/O. Pure data definitions and tiny pure helpers (e.g. template token parsing) only.
- Changing a schema is a contract change: update API and web in the same commit.
